Stéfane,

The issue looks to be that you've exceed the 25 hour/month limit for 'active hours' that are included with the free plan for shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io>. You have a few options: 1) you can choose to upgrade to a paid plan, or 2) wait until next month when your 25 hour limit resets. You can see more about the plans here: http://www.shinyapps.io/#pricing

Hope that helps,
-Andy

