I think you have two options here:

1) If you update to a recent version of the RStudio IDE <http://www.rstudio.com/products/rstudio/download/> you can use the "Publish" button to deploy an doc. I *think* this will ensure that only the selected doc is examined for dependencies.

2) Alternatively, you can update to the latest version of shinyapps package and use the deployDoc() function which will do the same.

To update shinyapps:

devtools::install_github('rstudio/shinyapps')

-Andy

