I have a small survey app that takes information from a user (including address), writes that information to an internal file, then (among other things) uses the leaflet package to generate a map with markers for all who have taken the survey.

It works fine locally and on a Shiny Server at my institution (once the shiny user is granted permission to write to the appropriate /srv subdirectory).  But on shinyapps.io <http://shinyapps.io> the app fails as soon as a user submits his/her survey responses.  The error is shown in the attached screenshot:  it appears to be a problem loading the map object.

Any thoughts?

Homer

